putin would even be  happiest if the western part of ukraine  kind of was i don't know  taken in by the polls or became  independent and didn't basically kind of  as the russians would see it  infect the minds of ukrainians and kiev  and kharkiv and nepro with the idea of  the european feature future lots of the  kind of ideological outriders of the  kremlin keep talking about the fact that  it would actually be better for russia  if places like lev uh just went went  their way and became part of bigger  europe and then they could just get on  with basically assimilating uh places in  central and eastern ukraine  dw's nick connolly reporting tonight  from western ukraine as always nick  excellent reporting  stay safe thank you
 

